+0       <  P.  1:2(1)  ack 1  win 450    <mpcapable v1 flags[flag_h] key[skey, ckey] mpcdatalen 1, nop, nop>
+0     read(4, ..., 1) = 1
+0       >   .  1:1(0)  ack 2             <dss dack8=2 nocs>

